    "effect": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Effect",
      "value": "<p>When an enemy triggers an opportunity attack from you, and your opportunity attack is a natural even hit, you&nbsp;cause the triggering action to fail and the enemy loses&nbsp;that action.</p>\n<p>Once per battle, when an enemy engaged with you&nbsp;makes an attack that would not trigger an opportunity&nbsp;attack from you normally, you can make an opportunity&nbsp;attack against them anyway.</p>"
    },
